direction: right

Intern: Student Intern
Supervisor: Company Supervisor
Coordinator: Academic Coordinator
Admin: Organization Admin

SALIGAN: {
  label: "SALIGAN
Student Attendance, Logbook, Internship Goals, Accomplishments, and Notes"
  WebPWA: "Web PWA
React + Vite + IndexedDB"
  API: "API
NestJS + Fastify + OpenAPI"
  Domain: "Domain Package
Time computation + validation"
  Sync: "Sync Package
Offline operation queue"
  Exporters: "Exporters
PDF/DOCX/XLSX/CSV/ICS"
  DB: "PostgreSQL
Canonical records"
  Storage: "File Storage
Exports + attachments"
}

Intern -> SALIGAN.WebPWA: log DTR, notes, reports
Supervisor -> SALIGAN.WebPWA: review submissions
Coordinator -> SALIGAN.WebPWA: monitor progress
Admin -> SALIGAN.WebPWA: configure org/templates
SALIGAN.WebPWA -> SALIGAN.Sync: queue offline drafts
SALIGAN.WebPWA -> SALIGAN.API: REST API
SALIGAN.API -> SALIGAN.Domain: enforce rules
SALIGAN.API -> SALIGAN.Exporters: generate files
SALIGAN.API -> SALIGAN.DB: read/write
SALIGAN.API -> SALIGAN.Storage: store files
